  "details": "so, the furry hideout and the furry talk and chill have this ban panel that will teleport you to the banned area from the world and apparently it still works for group instance owners where they cannot teleport back to the spawn and are prevented from moderating their instances they own for there groups. If this isn't allowed please make it part of the guidelines. because this ban panel would be considered very abusive to group staff and owners.\n\nlike at any time the world owner could tell there admins and staff to go into your group public world and use this ban panel to teleport and prevent the owner of the group from accessing there group instance. this would mean they are prevented from moderating the instance they made for there groups to be safe. I personally want to prevent this war like stuff from getting out of hand.",
